        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Keep legacy WhatsApp crontab lint opt-in",
        "body": "## Summary\n- mark `core/doctor/legacy-whatsapp-crontab` default-disabled so default `doctor --lint` does not invoke the shell-backed `crontab -l` probe\n- preserve explicit selection through `--only core/doctor/legacy-whatsapp-crontab` and `--all`\n- add selection coverage proving default lint skips the probe while selected lint reports the warning\n\n## Public surface\n- No public SDK/plugin/config contract changes.\n- Default `doctor --lint` changes only by skipping this live crontab probe; `--all` and `--only` still include it.\n- Real repair/reporting behavior for the legacy WhatsApp crontab path remains owned by the existing Doctor implementation.\n\n## PR surface\n- 2 files changed, +45/-2 after rebasing on current `main` and resolving adjacent #99249/#99211 test coverage.\n\n## Real behavior proof\n- Head verified: `489e2af37056c2f78a43b282dd0c81d74193a9df`.\n- Command: `pnpm exec vitest run src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts --maxWorkers 1 --no-fileParallelism`.\n- Result: pass, 1 file / 70 tests.\n- Behavior covered: default lint selection skips `core/doctor/legacy-whatsapp-crontab` without calling `collectLegacyWhatsAppCrontabHealthWarning`; explicit `--only core/doctor/legacy-whatsapp-crontab` runs the check and reports the warning finding.\n\n## Validation\n- `pnpm exec vitest run src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts --maxWorkers 1 --no-fileParallelism`\n- `pnpm exec oxfmt --check src/flows/doctor-core-checks.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts`\n- `pnpm exec oxlint src/flows/doctor-core-checks.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts`\n- `git diff --check`\n\n## Not tested / baseline gaps\n- Full `pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit --project tsconfig.json --pretty false` currently fails outside this PR in `src/config/io.ts` / `src/secrets/config-io.ts` around `configWritePostCommitRollback` exported type naming. This PR does not touch those files.\n- I did not run the cron storage implementation test file; this PR only changes lint default selection for the existing WhatsApp crontab check and leaves storage/repair behavior unchanged.\n",
